  "name": "Remaining classes reported at 0% parry can parry once they learn Parry (#6775)",
  "contract": "Tome of Parry 1001186 (any class, level 10) teaches Parry 3124 (SPELL_EFFECT_PARRY), and live CoA combat logs show Bloodmage, Barbarian, Tinker and Runemaster players parrying without a class parry talent. With maxed defense skill and no parry rating or aura, Player::UpdateParryPercentage gives the flat 5 percent base chance once CanParry() is set. Bloodmage, Chronomancer, Necromancer and Pyromancer fell back to Druid, Priest, Warlock and Mage, whose parry cap is 0, so they stayed at 0 percent even with Parry learned.",
